                        rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 894; for minutes of the meeting, see
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp. 896–901.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d116-f2" n="43" xml:id="d116-f2-content">
                <p>M. C. Zumeta; Minister to France.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d116-f3" n="44" xml:id="d116-f3-content">
                <p>Polish member, vice chairman and <hi rendition="#italic">rapporteur</hi> of the
                    Committee.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
